<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cancellation & Refund Policy | The Saran Trader</title>
    <meta name="description"
        content="Read the cancellation and refund policy of The Saran Trader carefully before making any purchases or subscribing to our educational programs.">

    <!-- CSS -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/output.css">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href="/images/favicon.jpg">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/images/favicon.jpg">
    
    <!-- Font Awesome -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
</head>

<body class="bg-brand-navy text-white font-sans antialiased">
    <!-- Navbar -->
    <%- include('../partials/layout_wrapper_top', { pageTitle: 'Refund Policy', wrapperBg: 'bg-brand-navy' }) %>

    <main id="main-content" class="<%= standardTopPadding %> pb-20">
        <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="text-center mb-16 animate-fade-in-up">
                <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold mb-6">
                    Cancellation & <span class="text-red-500">Refund Policy</span>
                </h1>
                <p class="text-xl text-slate-400">
                    Please read this policy carefully before enrolling in any of our programs.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white/5 border border-red-500/20 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-sm">
                
                <div class="prose prose-invert prose-brand max-w-none">
                    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
                        At <strong>The Saran Trader</strong>, we are committed to providing high-quality trading education, live mentorship, and valuable community interactions. Before making a purchase, we strongly advise you to read the program details, terms and conditions, and this policy.
                    </p>

                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-6 text-white border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
                        Strict No-Refund Policy
                    </h2>
                    
                    <div class="bg-red-500/10 border-l-4 border-red-500 p-6 rounded-r-lg mb-8">
                        <p class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-2">Important Notice:</p>
                        <p class="text-slate-300">
                            <strong>There is a strict NO REFUND policy on all our courses, mentorship programs, and subscriptions.</strong> 
                            Once you have subscribed or enrolled in a program, the fees paid are completely non-refundable under any circumstances.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6">
                        By completing a purchase on <strong><a href="<%= links.platform.home %>">thesarantrader.com</a></strong>, you explicitly agree that:
                    </p>

                    <ul class="space-y-4 text-slate-300 mb-8 list-none pl-0">
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-red-500 mt-1"></i>
                            <span>You will not be eligible for a refund if you change your mind after the purchase.</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-red-500 mt-1"></i>
                            <span>You will not be eligible for a refund due to hardware, software, or internet connectivity issues on your end.</span>
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-red-500 mt-1"></i>
                            <span>You will not be eligible for a refund if you fail to attend live sessions or do not complete the course materials.</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>

                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-6 text-white border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
                        Cancellation Policy
                    </h2>
                    
                    <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6">
                        You may choose to stop using our platform or cancel your account at any time. However, canceling your account or ceasing to use the platform <strong>does not entitle you to a refund</strong> of any past payments.
                    </p>

                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-6 text-white border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
                        Contact Us
                    </h2>
                    
                    <p class="text-slate-300">
                        If you have any presale questions about our courses or platform, please contact us <strong>before making a purchase</strong> so we can ensure our programs are the right fit for you.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-slate-300 mt-4">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope text-brand-gold mr-2"></i> 
                        <a href="<%= links.contact.supportUrl %>" class="text-brand-gold hover:underline font-bold">
                            <%= links.contact.email %>
                        </a>
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <%- include('../partials/layout_wrapper_bottom') %>

    <script src="/javascripts/main.js" defer></script>
</body>

</html>
